  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c81d4b4efd64fa4ba77a284cf4062c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  speachNumber: 2
  speach:
  - You have an extremely realistic mask! Did you make it yourself?
  - You nod.
  - Such a pity, you spent all this time on your mask while the only thing.
  - I care about is what you have underneath it.
  - Take it off, please.
  - Sure&&Nah!
  - Sorry, you just have... such a unique face.
  - It's so... round... and smooth.
  - You blush, slightly unsure of whether this is a compliment or insult.
  - Anyways, unmasked friend of mine, how are you enjoying the party so far?
  - Honestly, you have never enjoyed social occasions,
  - the expectations put upon you by others to perform to their standards has always
    grated away at your mental health
  - as you slowly feel yourself lose autonomy during conversations.
  - I'm having a great time!&&I don't like parties. But maybe this one will be different.
  - Sorry, I've gotta leave you now for a bit to say hello to an old friend.
  - I'll see you around later perhaps?
